WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
Hi, I'm Madeline.

2
00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:01.800
I'm Lulu.

3
00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.600
I'm Eleanor.

4
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.000
I'm Olivia, and we're
the Chi O philanthropy chairs.

5
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.300
Chi Omega's philanthropy is Make-A-Wish.

6
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.215
Make-A-Wish is a nonprofit
organization that grants wishes

7
00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:12.900
to children who have been
diagnosed with critical illnesses.

8
00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:16.712
Over the years, our chapter
has donated over $400,000

9
00:00:16.712 --> 00:00:20.700
and contributed 3,000 volunteer
hours to making wishes come true.

10
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.430
We host wish reveals right
here at our house where we

11
00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.700
get to meet the children
whose wishes we're granting.

12
00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.400
That's when you truly understand why
we put so much effort into this cause.

13
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.700
One of our biggest events
in the spring is Chi O Crawfish.

14
00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.335
We get to host hundreds of people
from the community at our house,

15
00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:38.900
have fresh crawfish
for everyone and a live band.

16
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:43.400
Every crawfish ticket sold directly impacts
a child's life in a real, tangible way.

17
00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.340
That's the magic of Chi O Crawfish.

18
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.900
It's not just a fundraiser, it's
a community coming together to change lives.

19
00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:52.090
Beyond Chi O Crawfish, we also
host a fall event that helps us

20
00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:55.040
continue our fundraising and deepens
our connection with Make-A-Wish.

21
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.460
Every wish granted is a child that got
to experience joy when they needed it most

22
00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:02.160
and a family that has
memories to hold on to.

23
00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.926
Together, we're making wishes come true,

24
00:01:03.926 --> 00:01:06.000
and that's what being
a Chi Omega is all about.

25
00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:16.300
[Music]
